  "notes": [
    "Place Si5351A, ADG918, OPA656 in a dedicated analog island",
    "Split In2.Cu power plane: digital +3V3 vs analog +3V3, connected at single point",
    "Use ferrite bead on +3V3_ANA input from TPS7A4700",
    "TEC driver carries high current — route on F.Cu + B.Cu paralleled",
    "Keep USB-C ESD protection diodes near connector"
